    "diagnosis": "Oral epithelial dysplasia, moderate",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Drop-shaped rete processes with increased mitotic figures, reduced keratinocyte cohesion, and abnormal variation in nuclear size, extending to the spinous layer.",
    "source": "Susan Muller",
    "copyright": "",
