    "chapterId": 106,
    "fileId": 27701,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Oral epithelial dysplasia, severe",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Increased keratinization, loss of cohesion in the prickle cell layer, and increased numbers of basaloid cells with mild hyperchromatism and anisonucleosis with budding and downward growth.",
    "source": "Susan Muller",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/52/106/27701.jpg",
    "thumbnail": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/52/106/thumb_27701.jpg"
  },
  {
