    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Oral epithelial dysplasia, mild",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Band-like inflammatory infiltrate at the epithelial&ndash;stromal interface imparting a lichenoid appearance including apoptotic degeneration of keratinocytes but with general preservation of a slightly expanded and hyperchromatic basal cell layer.",
    "source": "Susan Muller",
    "copyright": "",
