    "title": "",
    "legend": "Band-like inflammatory infiltrate at the epithelial&ndash;stromal interface imparts a lichenoid appearance, but loss of basal cell polarization, nuclear hyperchromasia, and mitoses extending to the mid-third of the atrophic epithelium excludes oral lichen planus.",
